{% doc %}
  Size Guide — Official Measurements (M to XXL) & Clean Minimalist UI

  - Measurements strictly synced with official specification PDF (Adot_hoodies_sweatshirts_size_chart.pdf).
  - Sizes: M, L, XL, XXL (No XS/S for hoodies & sweatshirts).
  - Native <dialog> with zero-jerk scroll stability (programmatic focus with preventScroll: true).
  - 100% responsive fixed-layout table that fits cleanly on Desktop & Mobile with zero horizontal scroll.
  - Clean typographic column headers (Size, Chest, Length, Shoulder, Sleeve) without cluttered unit suffixes.
  - Active unit toggle (cm / in) with animated sliding indicator.
  - Active size row automatically highlighted based on current PDP variant.
{% enddoc %}

